        ],
        "text": "According to Tennessee Wine and Spirits Retailers Association, the case concerns Tennessee's residency requirement for liquor distributors, which the state requires a ten\u2011year period of residency before a distributor may operate."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Tennessee Wine and Spirits Retailers Association",
