            "pages": {
              "end": 9,
              "start": 9
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Tennessee Wine and Spirits Retailers Association, the petitioners argue that the residency requirement does not violate the dormant Commerce Clause because it treats in\u2011state and out\u2011of\u2011state products the same."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Carter G. Phillips",
