            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Carter G. Phillips, the respondents contend that the residency requirement is protectionist discrimination against out\u2011of\u2011state interests."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "53a7ffde21f8b6cda29d3d557ca38b4a338cd8ad3b5e90a7e581ba8eaa181038",
